          LightNingPrefs v1.0 - Preferences Editor for LightNing
                    copyright 1996 Pierre Delisle




Description
~~~~~~~~~~~
LightNingPrefs is a preferences editor for LightNing, the filelist generator for
Zeus BBS.

MUI 3.x needed...

Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
Simply  copy  the contents of the included LightNingPrefs directory anywhere you
like.  :)


Usage
~~~~~
To  run  LightNingPrefs, type LightNingPrefs in a shell/cli or just double-click
on its icon.

When   LightNingPrefs  is  running,  the  default  config  file  for  LightNing,
Zeus:Config/LightNing/LightNing.cfg, is loaded.

For the different LightNing options , look at "LightNing.doc"


LightNingPrefs options
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
In the bottom of LightNingPrefs window, there is a string where you can give the
name of the LightNing config file that you want to use.

The 'Ok' button saves the modifications with the actual config file name (string)

The 'Quit' button quits without saving modifications


